  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TIFA Foundation supports the Aceh Truth and Reconciliation Commission (TRC) in delivering its mandate for systematic investigations of past human rights abuses and alleged violence during Aceh civil war, and recommends a reconciliation mechanism incorporating resolution practices based on Acehnese customs.</narrative>
